  <para style="h">Timoteo 1</para>
  <para style="toc1">Timoteo 1</para>
  <para style="toc2">Timoteo 1</para>
  <para style="toc3">Tim1</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoteo 1</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Paulo nɛ ji Yesu Kristo bɔfo nɛ Mawu, wa Yiwamihelɔ ɔ kɛ Yesu Kristo wa Nutsɔ, nɛ lɛ pɛ ji wa hɛ nɔ kami ɔ tsɔ lɛ ɔ, <verse eid="1TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />nɛ ngma womi nɛ ɔ kɛ ya ha Timoteo ke:</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">Timoteo, o ngɛ kaa ye bi ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ níhi a mi. Dloomi kɛ mɔbɔ nami kɛ he jɔmi nɛ je wa Tsɛ Mawu kɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo dɛ mi ha mo.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lakpa tsɔɔmi he kɔkɔ bɔmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3-4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3-4" />Kaa bɔ nɛ i de mo benɛ i yaa Makedonia a, i kpa mo pɛɛ nɛ o hi Efeso konɛ o bɔ mɔde nɛ o tsi lakpa tsɔɔli ɔmɛ a nya. Nɛ o ha nɛ a jɔɔ nyazia munyu ɔmɛ kɛ juɛmi nɛ a hɛɛ ngɛ bɔfohi babauu a he, kaa a nɔ a maa gu kɛ na yi wami hemi ɔ. Kikɛmɛ a ni nɛ ɔmɛ woɔ nya sami kɛ sane bimihi kɛ baa, nɛ a yí kɛ bua we níhi nɛ a ngɔ Mawu blɔ nya tomi nɛ tsɔɔ kaa a ma na yi wami hemi kɛ gu hemi kɛ yemi nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 1:3-4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ hlae ji kaa Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ tsuaa Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ nɛ ngɛ lejɛ ɔ nɛ hyi tɔ kɛ suɔmi nɛ je tsui klɔuu kɛ susumi nɛ he tsɔ falefale kɛ hemi kɛ yemi nɛ pi si mi.<verse eid="1TI 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Se tsɔɔli nɛ ɔmɛ je yi mi tomi nɛ ɔ se nɛ a nyɛɛ nya sami kɛ yaka munyu se. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />A suɔ kaa a le mɛ kaa Mose mlaa tsɔɔli, be mi nɛ a juɛmi kpi jamɛ a mlaa amɛ a he. <verse eid="1TI 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Jamɛ a mlaa amɛ hi, ke a tsu a he ni ngɛ Mawu yi mi tomi ɔ nya. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Se tsa pi wɔ, nihi nɛ a he wa yi wami ɔ nɛ a wo jamɛ a mlaa amɛ ha; a wo kɛ ha yayami peeli, nihi nɛ a kɛ Mawu yí, atuã tsɔli, nihi nɛ gbiɛɛ nɔ, nɛ a kaa kita, nɛ a tuaa a tsɛmɛ kɛ a nyɛmɛ nɛ a gbee mɛ.<verse eid="1TI 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />A wo mlaa nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ a kɛ le yayami peeli a mi tso, nihi kaa ajuama bɔli kɛ nihi nɛ a he tsɔ we, nyumuhi nɛ a kɛ a he hwɔɔ si, nɔmlɔ juli, lakpatsɛmɛ kɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ peeɔ níhi nɛ kɛ anɔkuale tsɔɔmi ɔ kɔ we ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />A naa jamɛ a tsɔɔmi ɔ ngɛ Anunyami Mawu nɛ a gbaa lɛ ɔ e Manye Munyu ɔ nɛ a to kɛ wo ye dɛ kaa ma fiɛ ɔ mi.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />I naa Kristo Yesu, wa Nutsɔ ɔ si kaa e pee mi e tsɔli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake, nɛ e wo mi he wami nɛ ma nyɛ ma ye lɛ anɔkuale, <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />tse be ɔ, i ye Kristo he fɛu ngɛ be ko nɛ be ɔ mi nɛ i wa e se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ yi mi, nɛ i ye mɛ awi ngɛ blɔ slɔɔtohi a nɔ. Se kɛ ɔ, Mawu na mi mɔbɔ, ejakaa jamɛ a be ɔ mi ɔ, i li Kristo, nɛ i li nɔ́ nɛ i ngɛ pee ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Wa Nutsɔ ɔ mi mi jɔ, ejakaa e tsɔɔ mi blɔ nɔ nɛ i ma gu kɛ he e nɔ ma ye, nɛ lɔ ɔ ha nɛ i hyi tɔ kɛ Kristo Yesu suɔmi ɔ.<verse eid="1TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />E ji anɔkuale munyu, nɛ i suɔ kaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ le kaa Kristo Yesu ba je nɛ ɔ mi nɛ e ba he yayami peeli a yi wami, nɛ ami ji a kpɛti yayami peelɔ kpanaku. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Se Mawu na mi mɔbɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ Kristo nɛ ngɔ mi kɛ pee okadi nɛ e kɛ tsɔɔ nɔ tsuaa nɔ, bɔ nɛ e toɔ e tsui si kɛ haa yayami peeli kpanakuhi tete po, konɛ ni kpahi hu nɛ a na nɛ a le kaa mɛ hu a ma nyɛ ma na neneene wami. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />A ngɔ anunyami kɛ bumi kɛ ha Mawu kɛ ya neneene. Lɛ ji neneene Matsɛ, nɔ nɛ a nɛ lɛ, nɛ e gbo we, nɛ lɛ pɛ ji Mawu ɔ, nɛ e hyi kɛ nile ɔ. Amen. <verse eid="1TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Jehanɛ ɔ, ye binyumu Timoteo, nɔ nɛ i ngɛ mo fae nɛ o pee ji nɛ ɔ nɛ. Moo hwu Nutsɔ ɔ ta a saminya kaa bɔ nɛ Nutsɔ ɔ wo si kɛ gu gbali ɔmɛ a nɔ kaa o maa hwu ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />Nɛ o hɛɛ hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ Kristo mi ɔ mi kpɛii kɛ he nile kpakpa, nɛ o pee nɔ́ nɛ da, ejakaa ni komɛ bui a he nile tue nɛ a je blɔ pee nɔ́ nɛ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a le kaa e dɛ, nɛ a hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ Kristo mi ɔ laa mɛ. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Nimli nɛ ɔmɛ a ti ni komɛ ji Himeneo kɛ Aleksandro, nɛ i tu mɛ kɛ wo Abosiami dɛ nɛ e gbla a tue kɛ ya si benɛ a ma kpa Kristo biɛ ɔ he guɛ gbemi.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Sɔlemi he blɔ nya tomihi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Ye ga womi ji kaa a sɔle kɛ ha ni kpahi; nɛ a kpa Mawu pɛɛ nɛ e na mɛ mɔbɔ; nɛ a na Mawu si ngɛ níhi kulaa nɛ e maa pee ha mɛ ɔ he.<verse eid="1TI 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />A sɔle kɛ ha matsɛmɛ kɛ nihi kulaa nɛ ngɛ wa nɔ yee, aloo nihi nɛ hɛɛ blɔ nya a, konɛ wa nyɛ hi si ngɛ he jɔmi kɛ kpoo peemi kɛ je mi bami kpakpa ngɛ Mawu jami kɛ Nutsɔ ɔ he susumi mi. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Enɛ ɔ ji nɔ́ nɛ hi, nɛ e sa Mawu, wa Yiwamihelɔ ɔ hɛ mi, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />ejakaa e suɔ kaa a he nimli tsuo a yi wami nɛ a nu anɔkuale nɛ ɔ sisi, <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />kaa Mawu kake nɛ ngɛ, loko ji nimli adesahi hu ngɛ, nɛ Kristo Yesu nɛ lɛ nitsɛ hu e ji nɔmlɔ ɔ, e daa si ngɛ Mawu kɛ nimli tsuo a kpɛti, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />nɛ e ngɔ e wami ngɔ ha kaa kpɔmi nɔ́ kɛ ha nimli tsuo konɛ e kɛ pee mɛ kake. Enɛ ɔ ji munyu nɛ Mawu ngɔ ha je ɔ ngɛ be nɛ sa mi. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Nɛ e ji anɔkuale kaa enɛ ɔ he nɔuu nɛ a hla mi ngɛ, kaa Mawu bɔfo kɛ fiɛlɔ, nɛ ma tsɔɔ ma je li ɔmɛ Mawu blɔ nya tomi kɛ ha yi wami hemi kɛ gu hemi kɛ yemi nɔ ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 2:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, i suɔ kaa nyumuhi ngɛ he fɛɛ he a wo a ninehi nɛ he tsɔ nɔ, nɛ a sɔle, nɛ yayami ko loo muklii mi fumi loo ninyɛ ko be a mi. <verse eid="1TI 2:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9-10" />Nɛ yi ɔmɛ hu a pee ja a nɔuu ngɛ kpoo peemi kɛ juɛmi kpakpa kɛ he dlami mi. Nyɛ ha nɛ a na Kristo se nyɛɛli yi ɔmɛ kaa a mi jɔ nɛ a hi, pi ngɛ yi hɔɔmi loo june loo tadehi nɛ a he jua wa nɛ a ma kɛ dla a he ɔ mi . <verse eid="1TI 2:9-10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Yi ɔmɛ a bu tue nɛ a kase ni ngɛ kpoo peemi kɛ he si bami mi.<verse eid="1TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />I ha we yi ɔmɛ he blɔ kaa a tsɔɔ nyumu ɔmɛ ni aloo a ye a nɔ. Se mohu a pee dii ngɛ asafo ɔ kpehi a mi. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Mɛni he je? Ejakaa Adam ji nɔ nɛ Mawu bɔ kekle, nɛ e se loko ji e bɔ Hawa. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Nɛ tsa pi Adam nɛ Abosiami pee kuasia a, se Hawa i, nɛ lɔ ɔ kɛ yayami ba. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Enɛ ɔ he je nɛ Mawu ha yihi naa nɔ́ ngɛ bi fɔmi mi, se e ma he a yi wami ke ji a maa hi si ngɛ e nɔ hemi kɛ yemi kɛ kpoo kɛ kpakpa peemi kɛ suɔmi mi.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Nihi nɛ sa asafo nɔ hyɛli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Anɔkuale munyu ji kaa ke nɔ ko ngɛ hlae nɛ e pee asafo nɔ hyɛlɔ ɔ, lɛɛ e ngɛ ni tsumi kpakpa se die. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />E sa kaa asafo nɔ hyɛlɔ nɛ e pee nɔmlɔ kpakpa nɛ a be e he munyu yaya ko tue, nɔ nɛ ngɛ yo kake, nɛ e tsuɔ ni wawɛɛ, nɛ e ji kpakpa peelɔ kɛ juɛmitsɛ nɛ peeɔ nɔ́ ngɛ e blɔ nɔ. E hine nɔ ko nɛ bua jɔɔ nibwɔhi a he ngɛ e we mi kɛ nɔ nɛ le Ngmami Klɔuklɔu ɔ tsɔɔmi. <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />E kó pee da delɔ loo pɛlɔ, se mohu nɔ nɛ e mi jɔ nɛ e he hu jɔ nɛ e hɛ kɔɛ sika nɔ. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />E hine nɔ nɛ tsɔsemi kpakpa kɛ bumi ngɛ e we mi, nɛ e bimɛ buɔ lɛ tue ngɛ kpoo kɛ oya mi. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />Ejakaa ke e nyɛ we lɛ nitsɛ e we nyafii nɔ nɛ e hyɛ ɔ, kɛ e maa pee kɛ ye kɛ bua asafo mluku ɔ kɛɛ?<verse eid="1TI 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />Nɔ nɛ ba sɛ Mawu jami ɔ mi kɛ we ɔ, e ko pee asafo nɔ hyɛlɔ, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ e ko wo e he nɔ kaa e na jamɛ a blɔ nya a mla, ejakaa he nɔ womi kɛ si gbeemi baa. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />E sa nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ ngɛ se, nɛ a pi Mawu jali ɔ hu a tu e he munyu kpakpa, konɛ e nyɛ nɛ e kpaka asafo ɔ kɛ he jɔmi nɛ Abosiami nɛ ko na nya pomi níhi fuu ngɛ e he nɛ e tsɔ̃ lɛ klama.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Asafo ɔ mi sɔmɔli ɔmɛ hu e sa kaa a pee nimli kpakpahi, nihi nɛ ngɛ pɛpɛɛpɛ kaa nɔ hyɛli ɔmɛ. A ko pee da deli kɛ nihi nɛ a hɛ tsuɔ ngɛ sika he. <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />E sa kaa a pee anɔkua Kristo se nyɛɛli kulaa, nɔ nɛ lɛ ji a he wami nɛ a nɛ ngɛ a hemi kɛ yemi ɔ mi. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Se e sa nɛ a ka nimli nɛ ɔmɛ a subai kɛ a mɔde bɔmi kɛ ni tsumi kpahi ngɛ asafo ɔ mi nɛ a hyɛ ha lolo; nɛ ke a tsu ni saminya a, loko ji a ngɔ sɔmɔmi ni tsumi ɔ kɛ wo a dɛ.<verse eid="1TI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />A yi ɔmɛ hu, a pee juɛmitsɛmɛ, pi sieku yeli kɛ da deli, se mohu anɔkuale yeli ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ mi. <verse eid="1TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Asafo nɔ hyɛlɔ ɔ kɛ yo kake too nɛ hi si ngɛ bua jɔmi mi, nɛ a bimɛ nɛ pee bimɛ nɛ ngɛ tsɔsemi. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Nɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ sɔmɔɔ saminya a, ni kpahi maa bu mɛ, nɛ a ma na hɛ nɔ kami kɛ hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ Nutsɔ ɔ mi.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />I ngɛ mo ni nɛ ɔmɛ ngmae mohu, se i heɔ yeɔ kaa e be kɛe nɛ i ma ba o ngɔ. <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />Se ke ye bami ɔ sɛ kɛ ɔ, nɔ́ nɛ ɔmɛ ma ha nɛ o le nihi nɛ sa nɛ o hla kaa sɔmɔli kɛ ha Mawu hɛ kalɔ ɔ asafo nɛ daa si ha anɔkuale munyu ɔ.<verse eid="1TI 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />E ji anɔkuale kaa Mawu jami si himi wa mohu, se e wɛ kɛ ha Kristo, nɔ nɛ kple si kɛ ba zugba a nɔ ngɛ he lo mi, nɛ a nɛ yayami ko ngɛ e he ɔ. E he tsɔ ngɛ mumi mi, nɛ Mawu bɔfohi sɔmɔ lɛ. A fiɛ e he sane ngɛ jejeeje nɛ a he lɛ atuu ngɛ he fɛɛ he. A ngɔ lɛ kɛ ho hiɔwe ya ekohu ngɛ e anunyami ɔ mi.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Lakpa tsɔɔli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Se Mumi Klɔuklɔu ɔ deɔ wɔ paa ke ngɛ nyagbe be ɔmɛ a mi ɔ, asafo ɔ mi ni komɛ maa kpale ngɛ Kristo se, nɛ a ma ya nyɛɛ tsɔɔli nɛ hɛɛ Abosiami mumi a se. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Tsɔɔli nɛ ɔmɛ toɔ a hɛ mi nɛ a yeɔ lakpa nɛ a he nile bui mɛ fɔ. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />A deɔ ke e sɛ kaa a ngɔ yo loo a ye de lo, níhi nɛ Mawu bɔ kɛ ha Kristo se nyɛɛli ke a ye nɛ a na lɛ si ngɛ he ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Ejakaa nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ Mawu bɔ ɔ hi, nɛ wa ma nyɛ ye kɛ bua jɔmi ke wa na si ngɛ he, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />nɛ wa bi Mawu ke e jɔɔ nɔ ha wɔ ɔ, ejakaa a kɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ kɛ sɔlemi tsukɔɔ he.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Ke ji o gba enɛ ɔ mi kɛ tsɔɔ ni kpa amɛ ɔ, lɛɛ o ngɛ o ni tsumi ɔ tsue kaa osɔfo kpakpa, nɔ nɛ hemi kɛ yemi kɛ anɔkuale tsɔɔmi nɛ e ngɛ se nyɛɛe ɔ pi si ngɛ e mi.<verse eid="1TI 4:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Ko puɛ o be ngɛ yaka nya sami kɛ nyazia munyuhi a he. Se mohu o ngɔ o be kɛ o he wami ɔ kɛ tsu mumi mi he wami nami he ni. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Nɔmlɔ tso ɔ he wami nami he mɔde bɔmi hi, se mumi mi he wami nami he hia wawɛɛ, ejakaa e nɔ nɛ nɔ́ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ o maa pee ɔ daa si ngɛ. Lɔ ɔ he je ɔ, moo bɔ o mumi ɔ he wami nami he mɔde, nɛ o gbo Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ kpakpa peemi he dengme, ejakaa lɔ ɔ maa ye kɛ bua mo ngɛ je nɛ ɔ mi kɛ je nɛ maa ba a hu mi. <verse eid="1TI 4:8" /><verse number="9-10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9-10" />Enɛ ɔ ji anɔkuale ɔ nɛ sa kaa nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ pɛtɛ he. Wa ngɛ dengme gboe, nɛ wa ngɛ nɔ nae ngɛ enɛ ɔ he, konɛ nihi nɛ a he nɛ a ye, ejakaa wa ngɛ hemi kɛ yemi ngɛ Mawu hɛ kalɔ ɔ mi, nɔ nɛ ji nɔ tsuaa nɔ Yiwamihelɔ ɔ, titli ɔ, ni nɛmɛ nɛ he e yi wami hemi ɔ ye ɔ.<verse eid="1TI 4:9-10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />Moo tsɔɔ ni nɛ ɔmɛ, nɛ o bɔ mɔde nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ e kase mɛ saminya. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Ko ha he blɔ nɛ a ko bu mo, akɛnɛ niheyo wayo ji mo ɔ. Se mohu moo pee o he nɔ hyɛmi nɔ kɛ ha mɛ, nɛ a nyɛɛ o se ngɛ o tsɔɔmi kɛ je mi bami kɛ suɔmi kɛ hemi kɛ yemi kɛ susumi kpakpa mi. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Moo kane nɛ o tsɔɔ asafo ɔ Ngmami ɔmɛ, nɛ o fiɛ Mawu Munyu ɔ kɛ ya si be nɛ i ma ba lejɛ ɔ.<verse eid="1TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dloomi nɔ́ke nɔ he ni tsumi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Mo tsu Mawu dloomi nike ni ɔmɛ nɛ a ngɔ ha mo kɛ gu e gbali ɔmɛ a nɔ benɛ asafo nikɔtɔma amɛ wo a nine kɛ pue o yi kpɛti ɔ he ni. <verse eid="1TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Mo tsu dloomi nike ni ɔmɛ a he ni; mo wo o he kɛ wo o ni tsumi ɔ mi wawɛɛ konɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ nɛ na o mɔde bɔmi kɛ o nɔ yami. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Nɛ o hyɛ o he nɔ ngɛ nɔ́ tsuaa nɔ nɛ o maa pee kɛ nɔ́ nɛ o ma susu mi. Mo ko ngmɛɛ nɔ́ nɛ ji anɔkuale ɔ he, nɛ Mawu maa jɔɔ mo, nɛ e maa gu o nɔ kɛ ye kɛ bua ni kpahi.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Mo ko hyɛ nɔkɔtɔma ko hɛ mi, se mohu o kɛ nɔkɔtɔma nɛ tu munyu ngɛ he si bami mi kaa mo nitsɛ o tsɛ, nɛ o kɛ nihewi nɛ tu munyu kaa nyɛmimɛ nɛ o suɔ mɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />Moo hɛɛ yi nikɔtɔma amɛ kaa o nyɛmɛ, kɛ yiwi ɔmɛ hu kaa nyɛwenyɛmɛ nɛ o susuu a he ekpakpa.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Asafo ɔ nɛ hyɛ yihi nɛ a hunohi gbo nɛ a be yemi kɛ buali ɔmɛ a nɔ. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Se ke a ngɛ bimɛ loo bibimɛ ɔ, lɛɛ mɛ ji nihi nɛ sa nɛ a hyɛ a fɔli ɔmɛ a nɔ, ejakaa e sa nɛ a je kpakpa peemi sisi kɛ je we mi. Enɛ ɔ ji nɔ́ ko nɛ sa Mawu hɛ mi saminya.<verse eid="1TI 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Asafo ɔ nɛ hyɛ yihi nɛ a hunohi gbo nɛ a ji ohiafohi nɛ be nɔ́ ko ɔ a nɔ, nihi nɛ a ngɔ a hɛ kɛ fɔ Mawu nɔ kaa e maa ye kɛ bua mɛ, nɛ a hɛɛ sɔlemi mi nyɔ kɛ pia a; <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />se pi yalɔyihi nɛ yeɔ sieku kɛ ni nɛmɛ nɛ nyɛɔ je mi ngɔɔmi níhi a se nɛ a kpataa a klaa hɛ mi ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Enɛ ɔ nɛ pee mlaa ngɛ asafo ɔ mi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ nɛ a le nɛ a pee nɔ́ nɛ da konɛ piami ko nɛ ko ba a he.<verse eid="1TI 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Se nɔ nɛ hyɛ we lɛ nitsɛ e wekuli nɛ ngɛ ohia yee a nɔ, titli ɔ, lɛ nitsɛ e we mi bimɛ ɔ, lɛɛ e be he blɔ nɛ e tsɛɔ e he Kristo se nyɛɛlɔ, afani wɔ jalɔ ngɛ e he.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Yalɔyo nɛ suɔ kaa a pee lɛ asafo mi sɔmɔli ɔmɛ a ti nɔ kake ɔ, e sa nɛ e ye jeha nyingmi ekpa, nɛ e gba si kake pɛ; <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />nɛ e ji nɔ ko nɛ a tuɔ e he munyu kpakpa, nɛ e lɛ bimɛ saminya, nɛ e peeɔ nibwɔhi kɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli kɛ ni klɔuklɔu ɔmɛ tsuo kpakpa; nɛ e yeɔ kɛ buaa hiɔtsɛmɛ kɛ nihi nɛ pla, nɛ e naa mɔbɔ.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Se ahoyihi nɛ wɛ ɔ, e sɛ nɛ a ngɔ mɛ kɛ piɛ sɔmɔli nɛ ɔmɛ a he, ejakaa e kɛ we nɛ a jɔɔ kita nɛ a kã Kristo ɔ nɔ yemi nɛ a ya gbaa ekohu; <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />nɛ a maa bu mɛ fɔ, ejakaa a yi a kekle si womi ɔ nɔ. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />Pi enɛ ɔ kɛkɛ, se e maa ba mi kaa a maa pee hejɔ nɛ a ma bɔni sieku yemi kɛ nyɛɛ wehi a mi, nɛ a ma wo a nya kɛ wo nihi a sanehi a mi. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, i suɔ kaa ahoyihi nɛ wɛ ɔ, a gba ekohu nɛ a fɔ bimɛ, nɛ a hyɛ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a wehi a nɔ, konɛ a ko tu a he munyu yaya ko. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Nɛ e peeɔ mi kaa a ti ni komɛ je asafo ɔ mi momo nɛ Abosiami tɔtɔ a nane.<verse eid="1TI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />I ngɛ nyɛ kaie ekohu kaa a ko ngmɛɛ ahoyo ko he kɛ fɔ asafo ɔ nɔ, se mohu e wekuli nɛ a hyɛ e nɔ, konɛ asafo ɔ nɛ hyɛ ahoyihi nɛ be nɔ ko kɛ he ko nɛ a maa ya a a nɔ.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Asafo nɔ hyɛli a nɔ hyɛmi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Asafo nɔ hyɛli nɛ tsuɔ ni saminya a, e sa kaa a wo mɛ hiɔ saminya nɛ a bu mɛ hulɔ, titli ɔ, ni nɛmɛ nɛ gboɔ dengme ngɛ fiɛmi kɛ ni tsɔɔmi he ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Ejakaa Ngmami ɔ de ke, “Koo fi na nɛ gblɛɔ blɛfo ɔ nya, se mohu o ngmɛɛ e he nɛ e ye bɔ nɛ sa be mi nɛ e ngɛ ni tsumi ɔ nɔ ɔ.” Nɛ a de ngɛ he kpa ko hu ke, “Ni nɛmɛ nɛ tsuɔ ni ɔ, e sa kaa a woɔ mɛ hiɔ.”<verse eid="1TI 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Ke a po asafo nɔ hyɛlɔ ko nya a, koo bu lɛ fɔ, ja nihi kaa enyɔ loo etɛ ye odase kɛ si lɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Se ke e pee yayami ko tutuutu ɔ, lɛɛ e sa nɛ a kã e hɛ mi ngɛ asafo ɔ kulaa hɛ mi bɔ nɛ pee nɛ nɔ ko nɛ ko pee jamɛ a yayami ɔ hu.<verse eid="1TI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />I ngɛ mo fae ngɛ Mawu kɛ Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo kɛ bɔfo klɔuklɔu ɔmɛ a hɛ mi kaa o pee enɛ ɔ nɛ o ko hyɛ nɔ ko hɛ mi, ke ji o huɛ ji asafo nɔ hyɛlɔ ɔ aloo e pi o huɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Koo ye oya kɛ hla asafo nɔ hyɛlɔ ko, ke pi ja a, a ma de ke o le e yayami ɔmɛ se o ma o hɛ ngmɛ ngɔ fɔ a nɔ. Nɛ mo nitsɛ hu o hyɛ o he nɔ saminya ngɛ yayami he. <verse eid="1TI 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Moo nu wai bɔɔ be komɛ kaa tsopa ngɛ o muklii mi hiɔ nɛ nuu mo kpitikpiti ɔ he.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />O hɛ nɛ ko je nɔ kaa ni komɛ kaa asafo nɔ hyɛli po baa je mi yaya nɛ nɔ tsuaa nɔ naa; níhi kaa enɛ ɔmɛ ɔ, o ma nyɛ pee he nɔ ko. Se ngɛ yayami komɛ a blɔ fa mi ɔ, Kojomi Ligbi ɔ nɔ loko ji anɔkuale ɔ maa je kpo paa. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Ja a nɔuu a naa ni tsumi kpakpa nɛ asafo nɔ hyɛli komɛ tsuɔ, se be komɛ ɔ, e se kɛ ɔ loko ji a naa ni tsumi kpakpahi nɛ a tsuɔ ɔ.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="s1">Ni tsumi kɛ ni nami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Kristo se nyɛɛli nɛ ngɛ nyɔguɛ yemi sisi ɔ, a tsu ni wawɛɛ nɛ a bu a nutsɔ ɔmɛ. A ko ha nɛ e ba mi kaa a ma de ke Kristo se nyɛɛli ɔmɛ pi ni tsuli kpakpahi, nɛ a ye Mawu biɛ ɔ kɛ e tsɔɔmi ɔ he fɛu. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Nɛ ke a ngɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli nutsɔmɛ ɔ, lɔ ɔ tsɔɔ we kaa a pee hejɔ, se lɔ ɔ mohu nɛ e sa kaa a tsu ni kɛ a he wami kulaa, ejakaa a nyɛmimɛ Kristo se nyɛɛli nɛ a ngɛ yee kɛ ngɛ buae ɔ nɛ.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Timoteo, moo tsɔɔ mɛ anɔkuale nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ o wo mɛ he wami nɛ a ye nɔ. <verse eid="1TI 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />A ti ni komɛ ma kua Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo anɔkuale tsɔɔmi nɛ ɔmɛ mohu, se mɛ ji Mawu jami ɔ sipoku. <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />Nɛ nɔ fɛɛ nɔ nɛ maa tsɔɔ tsɔɔmi kpa ko ngɛ enɛ ɔ se ɔ, he nɔ wolɔ kɛ kuasia ji lɛ. E ji nɔ ko nɛ nui Kristo munyu ɔ sisi, nɛ e woɔ nya sami, hunga jemi kɛ muklii mi la womi nɛ kɛ he fɛu yemi, nɔ nya pomi kɛ nihi a he susumi yaya baa. <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />Kikɛmɛ a nya sali nɛ ɔmɛ ji nihi nɛ yayami ye a juɛmi nɔ nɛ a tui anɔkuale. A susumi ji Manye Munyu ɔ tsɔɔ ni nami. O kɛ mɛ nɛ ko bɔ.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Anɛ o ngɛ hlae kaa o ma na ni kpɔtɔɔ lo? Ke o bua jɔɔ o he nɛ o peeɔ kpakpa a, lɛɛ o na ni momo. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />E fɔɔ si paa kaa waa kɛ nɔ́ ko bɛ je nɛ ɔ mi, nɛ wa be nyɛe nɛ waa kɛ pɛsua tete po maa ya gbeje. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Enɛ ɔ he je ɔ, ke wa be sika se wa naa wa nya mi ngma kɛ he hami níhi bɔ nɛ sa kɛkɛ ɔ, e sa kaa wa bua nɛ jɔ wa he. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Se nihi nɛ nyɛɛ ɔ ni nami se ɔ, a peeɔ ni yaya slɔɔtohi, nihi nɛ puɛɔ mɛ nɛ haa a naa susumi yaya, nɛ nyagbe mi ɔ, e kɛ mɛ yaa hɛ mi kpatami mi. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Ejakaa sika suɔmi ji yayamihi kulaa a sipoku. Ni komɛ suɔ ni nami he je ɔ a kpale ngɛ Mawu se nɛ a ngɔ aywilɛho babauu kɛ fɔ mɛ nitsɛmɛ a nɔ.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Oo Timoteo, moo lɛɛ Mawu nɔmlɔ ji mo. Moo tu yayami ni nɛ ɔmɛ kulaa a nya fo, nɛ o di dami kɛ kpakpa peemi se; nɛ o kase e nɔ hemi kɛ yemi kɛ nyɛmi suɔmi kɛ tsui si tomi kɛ kpoo peemi. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Moo ya nɔ nɛ o hwu Mawu ta a, nɛ o pɛtɛ neneene wami nɛ Mawu kɛ ha mo ɔ mi wawɛɛ, nɔ́ nɛ he nɛ o jaje o he yayami ngɛ odase yeli fuu a hɛ mi ɔ.<verse eid="1TI 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />I ngɛ mo fae ngɛ Mawu hɛ mi, nɔ nɛ haa nihi kulaa wami ɔ, kɛ wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo, nɔ nɛ ye Manye Munyu ɔ he odase ngɛ Pontio Pilato hɛ mi nɛ e yi gbeye ɔ, <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />kaa o ye níhi kulaa nɛ e de mo ɔ a nɔ, konɛ a ko na piami ko ngɛ o he kɛ ya si wa Nutsɔ Yesu Kristo maa kpale kɛ ba. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Ejakaa e be kɛe nɛ Mawu Ope, nɔ nɛ a gbaa lɛ ɔ, nɛ lɛ pɛ ji Mawu he wamitsɛ kɛ Matsɛmɛ a matsɛ kɛ Nutsɔmɛ a nutsɔ ɔ, ma je Kristo kpo paa kɛ je hiɔwe, <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />lɛ Mawu nɔ nɛ pe nɛ gbo we gblee ɔ, nɛ e hii la nɛ he ngɛ gbeye mi ɔ. Nɔ nɛ nɔmlɔ adesa ko be nyɛe e he maa su ɔ, nɔ nɛ nɔmlɔ ko nɔmlɔ ko nɛ lɛ hyɛ, nɛ a be lɛ nyɛe maa na gblee ɔ. Lɛ ji nɔ nɛ sa yi jemi kɛ neneene he wami kɛ matsɛ yemi. Amen.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Mo de niatsɛ ɔmɛ ke a ko fĩa, nɛ a ko ngɔ a hɛ kɛ fɔ a sika amɛ nɛ se be kɛe ɔ nɔ, se mohu a ngɔ a hɛ kɛ fɔ Mawu hɛ kalɔ ɔ nɔ, nɔ nɛ haa wɔ wa hiami níhi kulaa, bɔ nɛ pee nɛ wa na bua jɔmi ɔ. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Mo de mɛ ke a pee kpakpa nɛ a plɛ niatsɛmɛ ngɛ kpakpa peemi mi; nɛ a ye kɛ bua nihi nɛ ngɛ hiami mi, <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />konɛ a na june nitsɛ ngɛ hiɔwe, he nɛ a yi ma na neneene wami ngɛ ɔ. Nɛ a hi Kristo se nyɛɛli a si himi kpakpa ngɛ hiɛ ɔ hulɔ.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Oo Timoteo! Mo tsu ni tsumi nɛ ɔmɛ nɛ Mawu to kɛ wo o dɛ ɔ. Nɛ o kɛ o he nɛ ko wo nihi nɛ fĩaa kɛ toɔ a nile nɔ ɔ a yakayaka nya sami ɔmɛ a mi. <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Nɔ́ nɛ he hia ngɛ je nɛ ɔ mi pe kulaa ji Mawu lemi, nɛ enɛ ɔ laa a ti ni komɛ. Mawu nɛ na mo mɔbɔ.<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>